{"articleNo":"56198","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=56198&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 하계 계절수업 대구통학버스 운행 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.06.01","hit":"7317","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp; <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2012학년도 여름계절수업을 진행함에 따라 대구지역에서 등, 하교하는 학생들의 교통편의를 제공하는 대구통학버스 운행을 다음과 같이 안내하오니 참고하시기 바랍니다</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">▶ 안내사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;1. 운행조건 : 2대 각2회(등, 하교) 운행</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;2. 운행기간 : 2012. 6. 25(월) ~ 2012. 7. 18(수) [15일]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;3. 제외일자 : 토요일, 공휴일, 6월27일(수), 7월4일(수), 7월11일(수)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;4. 운행대수 : 45인승 2대(단, 납부인원에 따라 증, 감차할 수 있음)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;5. 운행노선</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 등교</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 만촌역(07:20)→범어로타리(07:25)→시민회관(07:30)→평리네거리(07:40)→</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;학교(08:40)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 서부정류장(07:20)→광장코아(07:30)→성서홈플러스(07:40)→학교(08:40)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 하교</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:15)→평리네거리(19:10)→시민회관(19:20)→범어네거리(19:25)→</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">남부정류장(19:30)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:15)→성서홈플러스(19:10)→광장코아(19:20)→서부정류장(19:30)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;6. 후 원 금 : 90,000원</span></p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;7. 납부기간 : 2012. 6. 7(수)~20일(수), <font color=\"#ff007f\"><strong>납부기간이후에는 납입이 불가함</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;8.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 금융기관 : 농협 및 대구은행</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;9. 납부방법 : 원스톱서비스에서 학생지원-대구통학버스신청 메뉴에서 후원금</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;고지서(개인별 가상계좌 번호)를 발급하여 납부&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2012. 6. 1.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학&nbsp; 생&nbsp; 처</span></strong></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            </span>"}
